{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026IARquXzz3f1795880012.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>阿富汗庫納爾省一所中學附近發生爆炸，至少10人死亡，超過110人受傷。</p><p></p><p>事發後，不斷有傷者送院，病房內不少傷者都是兒童。爆炸發生在周六上午10時中學附近一棟房屋內，阿富汗當局指，屋內堆有用於採礦和爆破作業的炸藥，相信意外是由這些炸藥引致。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.AFG.BLAST-2300_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026A6ndIJjppD1795880061.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>據報道，採礦業是阿富汗的支柱產業，但礦業公司的安全標準往往較低，導致事故頻發。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.AFG.BLAST-2300_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20262QmvP4ESDI1795880078.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T16:21:30.982986+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":159,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T14:33:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T16:55:15.159292+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T16:14:45.289049+00:00","content_hash":"1836083e58f5a48cf4ec6b2b8c31b91eae2cccf03b9ba9f1367d2a5725c9e276","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}